WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.701
-It is time to play a game of
deception called

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:04.701
"True Confessions."

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.701
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:15.868
My opponents tonight
are co-hosting

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.701
"Miley's New Year's Eve Party,"

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:20.400
which starts on
New Year's Eve at 10:30 p.m.,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.167
right here on NBC and Peacock.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:26.367
Please welcome Miley Cyrus
and Pete Davidson!

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:28.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:29.667
-Came out hot.
-What up?

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.934
-Wow! Great to see you.
Nice to see you.

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:34.400
That's -- Come on!
-How are you?

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.901
-Looking fantastic.

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:38.267
-We came in hot.
-You really came in hot.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.601
Now, guys,
here's how this works.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:40.701
In front of us each

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.868
are two envelopes
containing confessions.

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.901
One is true. The other is a lie.

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.133
Once you read your confession,

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.667
the other two players
get to interrogate you.

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.601
Then they have to come to
a unanimous decision --

00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:52.767
is it the truth or is it a lie?

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.067
Miley, you will go first.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:55.133
Audience, which envelope
should she open?

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:57.000
1 or 2?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.868
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.968
-Always.
-Always 1?

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.767
-Number 1. Let's go.
-Let's start taking notes.

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:04.868
-Alright.
-[ Clears throat ]

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:19.567
♪♪

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:20.934
