Flavor Flav.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.033
-Oh, yeah, okay.
-This is very believable.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.634
-Okay.
This is very interesting, yeah.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:31.534
-Yeah.
-I, too, have met Flavor Flav.

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:32.734
