-And he was like "Gwen Stefani!"

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:46.968
-He went "Gwen..." for like --

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.567
It's still happening somewhere
in another universe.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.501
It's still happening.
-I think that's true.

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:52.601
