00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:10.601
-Yes.
-So that's very confusing.

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:12.234
-Yeah, it was very confusing.

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:14.901
-I think this is funny
and I think it's a true story.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.200
-I think it's super-true.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.667
-I think it's true.
-When do I say?

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:18.667
-Yes, now.

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:19.767
-It's true.

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:21.267
