-There we go.

00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:25.200
-That's very true.
-Yeah.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.868
-Are you kidding me?
-No.

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.167
-So, you're debuting a new look,
